        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Liz Rose, Taylor Swift, Pat McLaughlin, Gary Allan\n- Songs: \"You Belong with Me,\" \"White Horse,\" \"Teardrops on My Guitar,\" \"Songs About Rain\"\n- Places: Dallas, Texas\n- Roles: country music songwriter, singer-songwriter, country music artist\n- Awards: Grammy Award\n\nFacts:\n- Liz Rose was born in Dallas, Texas.\n- Liz Rose is an American country music songwriter best known for her work with Taylor Swift.\n- Liz Rose co-wrote twenty of Taylor Swift's officially released songs and singles, including \"White Horse,\" \"Teardrops on My Guitar,\" and \"You Belong with Me.\"\n- \"You Belong with Me\" is a song performed by American singer-songwriter Taylor Swift.\n- In 2010, \"You Belong with Me\" won Liz Rose and Taylor Swift a Grammy Award.\n- \"Songs About Rain\" was written by Pat McLaughlin and Liz Rose and was recorded by American country music artist Gary Allan.",
